# M6 flow (D-047, D-097, D-098; a D-101 acceptance condition): the end of
# the playable journey on the real route. Title flow with the run started
# in Strobl: the flow_m6_strobl_to_bad_ischl inputs to the start of Bad
# Ischl play (2942: score 17300, lives 3, 34 Oblaten carried over), then
# the inputs of bad_ischl_solver.replay (Bad Ischl clear at 4793, the
# goal sequence past the queue at Café Zauner), then idle: the tally, the
# route map Bad Ischl -> Café Zauner (5279; the walk from 5319, primary
# label slots on this screen per D-098), the map in Wait, and with no
# START the Café Zauner intro (5643) with the run carried over (Normal,
# score 35600, lives 3, 75 Oblaten); the replay ends in the intro (5703).
# Shot: the map walk to Café Zauner (5330). D-102 (E42): Strobl 230 s and
# Bad Ischl 210 s shorten the tallies (10 and 60 frames), 10 idle frames
# fewer before Bad Ischl, the re-solved Bad Ischl route; the shot moved
# from 5400 to the same point of the walk. Re-cut for D-108 (M7): was
# flow_m6_bad_ischl_teaser_title, which ended on the teaser and the title;
# Stage 9 is playable now, so the map waits and leads into it. The shot
# keeps its frame (the walk is unchanged; the panel's third line can
# differ). The map in Wait is bad_ischl_tour's `route_map` shot (Normal)
# and flow_m6_hackl_bad_ischl_to_cafe_zauner's (Hackl).
level  = strobl
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1900..1900 deaths=0 no_event=Hurt
expect = event=LevelComplete state=stage_intro stage=cafe_zauner power=normal score=35600 lives=3 oblaten=75
shots  = 5330:map_walk
